  "descriptions": [
    "This dataset comprises all the Parliamentary Proceedings of the Dutch Parliament and Senate from 1930 until april 2012 in an enriched XML format. Each document covers a distinct meeting, documents are grouped in folders by decade. This dataset contains the semanticized text in FoLiA annotation. This dataset is part of the 2012 project PoliticalMashup.",
